                "prompt": "A gruff, deadpan middle-aged male mercenary crossbowman. Low gravelly baritone, dry and unhurried, working-class and thoroughly unimpressed — a craftsman who trusts gears and steel, not talent. Few words, flat delivery, a hint of tired humour. Never snobby, never booming, never squeaky. Perfect audio quality.",
