                "Cranking.",
                "Bolt's in.",
                "Point. Click.",
                "Who needs a bow?",
                "Winding up.",
                "Safety's off.",
                "Paid by the bolt.",
                "Bows are for poets.",
                "One quarrel, one problem.",
                "Steel string, steel nerves.",
